  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Namwala Dairy Cooperative Society Milk Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Dairy) Beneficiaries: 170 dairy farmers Town/City: Namwala, Southern Province Summary: The project funds will be used to expand the cooperative&apos;s business operations. The project funds will support activities including hiring and training of management; training of members in artificial insemination, animal husbandry, milk handling and hygiene; an input revolving fund and an additional chilling tank.</narrative>
  </description>
